  "macroRenderedOutput": {},
  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"single\"><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"732c8d45-6688-449a-a09d-b7c0d36a705e\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Compatibility</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p>Please note that the following documentations are relevant only for OpenERP 7. From Bahmni 0.92 onwards, we use Odoo version 10.</p><p>For Odoo configuration please refer <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/899973149/Odoo+modules\">Odoo modules</a></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"excerpt\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"6385a219-17e5-4785-9077-343ee971919f\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"atlassian-macro-output-type\">INLINE</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Bahmni integrates OpenMRS with OpenERP&nbsp;which is a an open source ERP product. It is useful in Billing, Pharmacy and Stock management. Any patient registered in OpenMRS is synced by Bahmni as a customer in OpenERP.&nbsp;</span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"25e8174e-0d2c-48cb-b902-891067cd60c6\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>Since Odoo/OpenERP is an open source product with thousands of existing customers and a community &ndash; its own online documentation is also available online here: <a href=\"https://doc.odoo.com/book/#books-link\">https://doc.odoo.com/book/#books-link</a>. You can also refer to this documentation to understand OpenERP better, or in cases where you need more clarity than the documentation provided by Bahmni on OpenERP.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"f30abfd1-b7ec-4905-9c9a-751371b5f3c8\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#1FA5A0</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">In this section</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"children\" ac:schema-version=\"2\" ac:macro-id=\"6d4d4185-75c0-4913-8626-225020e9e2d7\" /></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><p><br /></p><p><br /></p></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
      "representation": "storage",
      "embeddedContent": [],
      "_expandable": {
