      }
    },
    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout single\" data-layout=\"single\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"732c8d45-6688-449a-a09d-b7c0d36a705e\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><p class=\"title\">Compatibility</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Please note that the following documentations are relevant only for OpenERP 7. From Bahmni 0.92 onwards, we use Odoo version 10.</p><p>For Odoo configuration please refer <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/899973149/Odoo+modules\" rel=\"nofollow\">Odoo modules</a></p></div></div><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default conf-macro output-inline\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"6385a219-17e5-4785-9077-343ee971919f\" data-macro-name=\"excerpt\">Bahmni integrates OpenMRS with OpenERP which is a an open source ERP product. It is useful in Billing, Pharmacy and Stock management. Any patient registered in OpenMRS is synced by Bahmni as a customer in OpenERP. </span><br/></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"25e8174e-0d2c-48cb-b902-891067cd60c6\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Since Odoo/OpenERP is an open source product with thousands of existing customers and a community – its own online documentation is also available online here: <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://doc.odoo.com/book/#books-link\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://doc.odoo.com/book/#books-link</a>. You can also refer to this documentation to understand OpenERP better, or in cases where you need more clarity than the documentation provided by Bahmni on OpenERP.</p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"f30abfd1-b7ec-4905-9c9a-751371b5f3c8\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: white;\"><b>In this section</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p> </p><ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"6d4d4185-75c0-4913-8626-225020e9e2d7\" data-macro-name=\"children\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/21790747/OpenERP+Basic+Configurations\" data-linked-resource-id=\"21790747\" data-linked-resource-version=\"11\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">OpenERP Basic Configurations</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114627969/OpenERP+Syncing+Config\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114627969\" data-linked-resource-version=\"8\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">OpenERP Syncing Config</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/28311588/OpenERP+Custom+fields\" data-linked-resource-id=\"28311588\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">OpenERP Custom fields</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/5570574/OpenERP+Custom+Filters\" data-linked-resource-id=\"5570574\" data-linked-resource-version=\"4\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">OpenERP Custom Filters</a></li></ul><p> </p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
